{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/322356-canon-rank-6-legend-glass-walkers","id":322356,"title":"Canon Rank 6 (Legend) Glass Walkers?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-11-25T19:41:41-08:00","id":322356,"title":"Canon Rank 6 (Legend) Glass Walkers?","content":"Who were the Legend (Rank 6) Glass Walkers in White Wolf canon? <br /> What are the sources (book and page # if possible) for them?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">- Arthur &quot;Torakhan&quot; Dreese <span style=\"color:silver\"><b>David &quot;Wall-of-Text&quot; Tealdeer</b> - US2012070036\u200b - Grand Rapids, MI</span><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img855/1250/jv8k.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nmeqe3m\" target=\"_blank\">V:tM 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/pavtnjj\" target=\"_blank\">Hunters Hunted II</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/l3hjgjt\" target=\"_blank\">Anarchs Unbound</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\">W:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\">W20 Changing Breeds</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/m64m9o5\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3rd Edition</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/qxkop7m\" target=\"_blank\">M:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\">W20BotW</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/780-torakhan","name":"Torakhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar780_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"576"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-26T15:10:09-08:00","id":323192,"title":"","content":"IIRC, the most well-known is Gianluigi &quot;Lucky&quot; Luciano, founder of the Wise Guys - Revised GW Tribebook, NPC section.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3118-cifer","name":"Cifer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3118_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-27T10:59:48-08:00","id":323746,"title":"","content":"Unfortunately, it never actually states what his rank was. The term &quot;a legendary pack&quot; is used, and he was obviously influential... but no sign of being Rank 6. :-/<br /> I suppose it could be assumed he did by age 65.<br /> Alas, it's one of those things where the game's books are written less for mechanical-factual information, and more for an ST to fill in the gaps... but doesn't help much when you have a global game and need some of that information so that all players have the same knowledge. :-/","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">- Arthur &quot;Torakhan&quot; Dreese <span style=\"color:silver\"><b>David &quot;Wall-of-Text&quot; Tealdeer</b> - US2012070036\u200b - Grand Rapids, MI</span><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img855/1250/jv8k.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nmeqe3m\" target=\"_blank\">V:tM 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/pavtnjj\" target=\"_blank\">Hunters Hunted II</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/l3hjgjt\" target=\"_blank\">Anarchs Unbound</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\">W:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\">W20 Changing Breeds</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/m64m9o5\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3rd Edition</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/qxkop7m\" target=\"_blank\">M:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\">W20BotW</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/780-torakhan","name":"Torakhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar780_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"576"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-27T12:11:44-08:00","id":323812,"title":"","content":"Here's a thought that might be interesting; There are no rank 6 Glass Walkers. Maybe its because the tribe has changed too much in too short a time. Maybe their ways are too alien to gain that honour.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-27T16:27:47-08:00","id":323946,"title":"","content":"An interesting concept, and though I get the odea behind it, I don't know if I'd go along with it.. but maybe that's the intent.<br /> <br /> So, a related question, do the books offer any other official Rank 6 characters? What books are those in? Their Tribebooks, or other books?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">- Arthur &quot;Torakhan&quot; Dreese <span style=\"color:silver\"><b>David &quot;Wall-of-Text&quot; Tealdeer</b> - US2012070036\u200b - Grand Rapids, MI</span><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img855/1250/jv8k.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nmeqe3m\" target=\"_blank\">V:tM 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/pavtnjj\" target=\"_blank\">Hunters Hunted II</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/l3hjgjt\" target=\"_blank\">Anarchs Unbound</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\">W:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\">W20 Changing Breeds</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/m64m9o5\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3rd Edition</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/qxkop7m\" target=\"_blank\">M:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\">W20BotW</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/780-torakhan","name":"Torakhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar780_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"576"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-27T17:17:32-08:00","id":323960,"title":"","content":"Albrecht is one TB Silverfang (rev), pretty sure they have the Margrave in TB Shadwlords Revised. The first ever Statted Rank 6 Garou I believe was Golgol FangsFirst of the Get of Fenris in one of the Amazon sourcebooks and later in the Get of Fenris TB. I think Wepwuwet (sp?) of the SilentStriders may be Rank 6 too, but he's also technically an old school mummy who made it through the Storm..,<br /> <br /> I'm pretty sure the Glasswalkers don't have a Rank 6 anywhere in their history, pretty much the same for the BoneGnawers or Stargazers iirc. Sergei Dawntreader might be one for the CoG but I'm sure he's just a very good R5 just like Altair is for the Stargazers. As for the other tribes I would imagine historical figures but none current.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2767-moirdryd","name":"Moirdryd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-27T18:40:30-08:00","id":324035,"title":"","content":"Having read up on Lucci (where did I read the other last name?), his rank is indeed not spelled out. However, phrases like &quot;there's no question that he made the tribe what it is today&quot; and &quot;there's not a personality in Glass Walker history that can match him&quot; IMO very strongly point in that direction.<br /> <br /> I also disagree about the tribe not being able to have rank 6 members at all - it`s disproven by the defeat of the Storm Eater, which required rank 6 Garou of all thirteen tribes.<br /> <br /> Edit: Oh. Looks like Luciano may have been the real-world inspiration for the Glasswalker. Figures.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3118,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3118-cifer","user":"Cifer","date":". 11-27-2014, 09:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3118-cifer","name":"Cifer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3118_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-27T20:31:48-08:00","id":324170,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cifer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/322356-canon-rank-6-legend-glass-walkers?p=324035#post324035\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I also disagree about the tribe not being able to have rank 6 members at all - it`s disproven by the defeat of the Storm Eater, which required rank 6 Garou of all thirteen tribes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Its mainly just a thought experiment. But note that during Storm Eater's time, there were no Glass Walkers, there were Iron Riders. Glass Walkers as a tribe name/way is.. I dunno, 70 years old at most? And considering they changed radically between editions (mob with clear houses to hackers and who knows -what- for w20) which could not be but 5 or so years in between, I think its possible no Walkers has reached rank 6 yet.<br /> <br /> It might be silly to think this, but Lucci might have been an Iron Rider? Correct me if I'm wrong.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-28T03:56:57-08:00","id":324375,"title":"","content":"The tribe renaming of the Iron Riders to Glass Walkers happened before the Wise Guys gained dominance - according to the rev tribebook (page 30), the Iron Riders started falling apart in 1883 and the Glass Walkers took over soon after, with a short span of dominance around the turn of the century before being replaced by the Wise Guys who gained dominance in 1922 (page 55). Lucci was born in 1895, so his first change should have happened right in the middle of the real Glass Walker period.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3118,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3118-cifer","user":"Cifer","date":". 11-28-2014, 07:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3118-cifer","name":"Cifer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3118_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-28T04:13:28-08:00","id":324401,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cifer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/322356-canon-rank-6-legend-glass-walkers?p=324375#post324375\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The tribe renaming of the Iron Riders to Glass Walkers happened before the Wise Guys gained dominance - according to the rev tribebook (page 30), the Iron Riders started falling apart in 1883 and the Glass Walkers took over soon after, with a short span of dominance around the turn of the century before being replaced by the Wise Guys who gained dominance in 1922 (page 55). Lucci was born in 1895, so his first change should have happened right in the middle of the real Glass Walker period.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, all right. Yeah, then they should have a rank 6 all ready.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-28T05:34:31-08:00","id":324422,"title":"","content":"&quot;Should have&quot; is a very strong term when talking Rank 6 Garou. They are UberRare after all that there are more than two or three at any time amongst the Tribes is a world altering thing in and of itself. Also, I'm pretty sure the StormEater required a heroic sacrifice from all thirteen tribes which was a pack from each... Thirteen Rank 6 Garou would have simply dealt with the problem and moved on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2767-moirdryd","name":"Moirdryd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-28T08:50:15-08:00","id":324571,"title":"","content":"I mean, never was there a canon Rank 6 Warder of Men, City Warder, Tetrasomian, Iron Rider, or Glass Walker? That doesn't seem likely. Even as quickly as the Tribe's ideals may change, their acts of Honor, Wisdom, and Glory are still respected for their time.<br /> <br /> But if I can't find a Glass Walker Rank 6, are there any others that are called out in any of the White Wolf books?<br /> <br /> <b>Or was Rank 6 something that was made up outside of the Werewolf: the Apocalypse canon, or introduced later in a supplement/Laws of the Wild/Apocalypse LARP rules?</b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">- Arthur &quot;Torakhan&quot; Dreese <span style=\"color:silver\"><b>David &quot;Wall-of-Text&quot; Tealdeer</b> - US2012070036\u200b - Grand Rapids, MI</span><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img855/1250/jv8k.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nmeqe3m\" target=\"_blank\">V:tM 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/pavtnjj\" target=\"_blank\">Hunters Hunted II</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/l3hjgjt\" target=\"_blank\">Anarchs Unbound</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\">W:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\">W20 Changing Breeds</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/m64m9o5\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3rd Edition</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/qxkop7m\" target=\"_blank\">M:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\">W20BotW</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/780-torakhan","name":"Torakhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar780_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"576"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-28T08:52:26-08:00","id":324573,"title":"","content":"Unofficial Wiki<br /> <a href=\"http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Rank_(WTA\" target=\"_blank\">http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Rank_(WTA</a>)<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> On extremely rare occasions a werewolf can reach a sixth rank which is not technically possessed of a specific name, but often described either as Elder or Legend. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">- Arthur &quot;Torakhan&quot; Dreese <span style=\"color:silver\"><b>David &quot;Wall-of-Text&quot; Tealdeer</b> - US2012070036\u200b - Grand Rapids, MI</span><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img855/1250/jv8k.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nmeqe3m\" target=\"_blank\">V:tM 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/pavtnjj\" target=\"_blank\">Hunters Hunted II</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/l3hjgjt\" target=\"_blank\">Anarchs Unbound</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\">W:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\">W20 Changing Breeds</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/m64m9o5\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3rd Edition</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/qxkop7m\" target=\"_blank\">M:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\">W20BotW</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/780-torakhan","name":"Torakhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar780_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"576"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-28T08:59:48-08:00","id":324575,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Moirdryd</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/322356-canon-rank-6-legend-glass-walkers?p=324422#post324422\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Should have&quot; is a very strong term when talking Rank 6 Garou. They are UberRare after all that there are more than two or three at any time amongst the Tribes is a world altering thing in and of itself. Also, I'm pretty sure the StormEater required a heroic sacrifice from all thirteen tribes which was a pack from each... Thirteen Rank 6 Garou would have simply dealt with the problem and moved on.</div> </div> </div> </div>Take a look at the Wyld West expansion pack, page 10, The Rite of Still Skies, then. It appears the Storm Eater itself was a little more powerful than you give it credit for.<br /> <br /> @Torakhan<br /> No, there are a few Garou noted to be Rank 6 within the Tribebooks - among them are the Margrave (Rev Shadowlord, page 99) and Albrecht (um... somewhere in Silverfang Revised?). Konietzko has full stats including rank and I believe so does Albrecht.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3118-cifer","name":"Cifer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3118_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-28T09:34:09-08:00","id":324588,"title":"","content":"Gol Gol has full stats on page 40 of the Rage Across the Amazon book, he is listed as a rank 6, and has a level 6 gift as well. It is the first place that &quot;Unstoppable Warrior&quot; is listed. Rank 6 has been around since the 1st ed. As for Albrecht he is listed in the back with famous Silver Fangs in the revised edition tribe book with stats, listed as a rank 6, and has the lvl 6 ahroun gift &quot;One on One&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-28T10:31:45-08:00","id":324656,"title":"","content":"Golgol and thunders teeth, whom as I recall is a pretty big player in the fall scenarios. Doesn't look like there's any rank 6 in apocalypse . There is a rather powerful weaver drone though","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-28T11:21:43-08:00","id":324678,"title":"","content":"Would be cool to get a book just on Rank 6's. Could see sample gifts for all 16 (17 since spirals are different from howlers technically) tribes, plus rank 6 Fera. I know I wouldn't be opposed to seeing a Rank 6 Mokole gift...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-28T16:44:09-08:00","id":324856,"title":"","content":"Ah, that'd be a Retcon in the W20 line as to it's power then Cifer, because just check out what you have to do to become Rank 6 (which usually translates into the &quot;impossible&quot;, several times, by yourself).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2767-moirdryd","name":"Moirdryd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-28T16:48:05-08:00","id":324859,"title":"","content":"However the W20 corebook has rank 6 gifts stated out....so while it may seem impossible, the system is there to support their existence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-28T16:48:58-08:00","id":324860,"title":"","content":"...or did I just misunderstand the post before mine....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-28T16:59:14-08:00","id":324865,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Moirdryd</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/322356-canon-rank-6-legend-glass-walkers?p=324856#post324856\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah, that'd be a Retcon in the W20 line as to it's power then Cifer, because just check out what you have to do to become Rank 6 (which usually translates into the &quot;impossible&quot;, several times, by yourself).</div> </div> </div> </div>Or maybe the Storm Eater is just a little more powerful than you imagine - it has been likened to the manifestation of Beast Of War, which as we know took the sacrifice of an entire tribe to stop. If you think this is a retcon, I invite you to find the Rite of Still Skies in a pre-W20 book and quote what kind of sacrifice it took at that time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3118-cifer","name":"Cifer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3118_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-28T17:22:30-08:00","id":324895,"title":"","content":"In the Book of the Wyld the binding of the Storm Eater is considered a Pyhrric victory as it requires the sacrifice of thirteen father greatest heroes of the Garou Nation (one from each tribe) it doesn't specify Rank, which is the same ad what I recall from back in the day. Granted if it breaks free it I'll be nothing less than the Apocalypse. Also I've just noted that it requires 4 other Rank 6 (Legendary is the Rank name btw) Garou to create a new Rank 6 Garou, which is a weird thing given that we know when Albrecht abd Margrave got their Legendary Rank and there's some stuff on Golgol too and none of it involved other Legendary Garou doing a special Rite (Also Zhyzak is THE Rank 6 BSD, pretty sure no one &quot;confirmed&quot; her either). <br /> <br /> I think Rank 6 suddenly got weirdly more &quot;common&quot; than when we first saw it in Rage Across the Amazon and the places it's referenced in Revised.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2767-moirdryd","name":"Moirdryd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-29T08:00:30-08:00","id":325284,"title":"","content":"Not so common I don't think. I know in botw the spiral rank 6 skills have yet to actually be attained by anyone, and if there is only a handful of 6's in the world then well... Yeah. Do the cogs, or gnawers have any?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-29T09:38:49-08:00","id":325322,"title":"","content":"From what I know there are no other garou that are stated to be Legends. As for Fera, if you read between the lines, Black Tooth is one (he's stated to use the rank 6 Simba gift in the Bastet breed book) and One could argue Old-Man as he is Coyote's favored which is like once a generation thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-29T11:23:04-08:00","id":325445,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CeltSPZ</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/322356-canon-rank-6-legend-glass-walkers?p=325322#post325322\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From what I know there are no other garou that are stated to be Legends. As for Fera, if you read between the lines, Black Tooth is one (he's stated to use the rank 6 Simba gift in the Bastet breed book) and One could argue Old-Man as he is Coyote's favored which is like once a generation thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm fairly certain that Manyskins is explicitly Rank 6 due to using the favor of Coyote.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-29T12:14:33-08:00","id":325473,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/322356-canon-rank-6-legend-glass-walkers?p=325445#post325445\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm fairly certain that Manyskins is explicitly Rank 6 due to using the favor of Coyote.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> While I agree with you, its not explicitly stated like with the garou who's stats state &quot;Rank: 6&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-02T21:47:15-08:00","id":328908,"title":"","content":"Levels of Gifts are different than one's Rank. <br /> If I recall correctly, It's difficult to learn a Gift which has a higher level than your rank, but not necessarily impossible.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">- Arthur &quot;Torakhan&quot; Dreese <span style=\"color:silver\"><b>David &quot;Wall-of-Text&quot; Tealdeer</b> - US2012070036\u200b - Grand Rapids, MI</span><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img855/1250/jv8k.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nmeqe3m\" target=\"_blank\">V:tM 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/pavtnjj\" target=\"_blank\">Hunters Hunted II</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/l3hjgjt\" target=\"_blank\">Anarchs Unbound</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\">W:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\">W20 Changing Breeds</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/m64m9o5\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3rd Edition</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/qxkop7m\" target=\"_blank\">M:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\">W20BotW</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/780-torakhan","name":"Torakhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar780_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"576"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T13:52:40-08:00","id":329527,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Torakhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/322356-canon-rank-6-legend-glass-walkers?p=328908#post328908\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Levels of Gifts are different than one's Rank.<br /> If I recall correctly, It's difficult to learn a Gift which has a higher level than your rank, but not necessarily impossible.</div> </div> </div> </div>Elders having access to rank 6 gifts is much more unlikely, than, say, a cliath having fostern gifts. The difference in renown is massive. Spirits don't generally don't make exceptions to the binding pacts that govern gift-learning. I see no reason to suspect such an exception happened with Black Tooth or Manyskins.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-20T12:45:35-08:00","id":770213,"title":"","content":"In Rage across New York one of the suggested plots is to cure &quot;PRIDE OF THE PACK&quot; from harano.<br /> He is regarded as the greatest garou of all his tribe and the one who carried it to what it is today.and a rank 6 homid philodox.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9531-snagar","name":"Snagar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-22T14:25:29-08:00","id":771719,"title":"","content":"Grinfang is a rank 6 Silver Fang from the Rage across Russia. I believe there is also a rank 6 Stargazer listed there as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1250-shadowlost","name":"Shadowlost","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1250_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-23T03:14:16-08:00","id":772192,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CeltSPZ</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/322356-canon-rank-6-legend-glass-walkers?p=325322#post325322\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From what I know there are no other garou that are stated to be Legends. As for Fera, if you read between the lines, Black Tooth is one (he's stated to use the rank 6 Simba gift in the Bastet breed book) and One could argue Old-Man as he is Coyote's favored which is like once a generation thing.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The Bubastis have 6 rank 6, they rules them since millenias as they are &quot;immortals&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8944-tanakyelle","name":"Tanakyelle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8944_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-24T00:15:48-08:00","id":772857,"title":"","content":"Black Tooth actually had Royal Privilege (Bastet Breed Book, 117), a gift that allowed him to snatch any gift he didn't already have by eating the former owner - so he could have technically been rank 0 and wielded gifts of any level, if he had this one gift from the start. But since this gift itself is rank 6, he is much more likely to be up there... Well, it is taught by the Unmaker, and we know HE gave out rank 3+ gifts as rank 1 to his corrupted Ajaba, so he could have broken the rules here too and taught it much earlier to BlackTooth. Maybe all the time with the intent to corrupt the hyenas?!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9729-hira-akigi","name":"Hira Akigi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-25T02:10:06-08:00","id":773753,"title":"","content":"Is it an actual list of all the rank 6 Garou and Fera ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8944-tanakyelle","name":"Tanakyelle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8944_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-25T07:40:11-08:00","id":773951,"title":"","content":"I'd love a book on rank 6's. What it means to be one, gifts for each tribe that didn't get one in the w20 core (I hated the Fianna one where you just slept from the original tribe book), breeds, and the fera (I'd love a rank 6 mokol\u00e8 gift). A write up on how to become one (I had a GM that felt to be rank 6 you had to be silver pack, while I had a player who felt rank 6 was a player right that was undeniable to them). What it means to be one (responsibilities, how others treat you, how well do the forces of the wyrm know you?).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1179,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","user":"CeltSPZ","date":". 11-25-2015, 11:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-25T08:41:56-08:00","id":773998,"title":"","content":"Agreed a Book of Legends with both Changing Breeds and Garou as well as quest examples and a selection of gifts for all tribes and breeds.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/293-lncbill","name":"lncbill","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar293_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}